Description: Multi-modal evidence ladders for tumor-board and clinical genomics review, integrating variants, pathways, and clinical data into a single decision-oriented panel.
    Part of the bioviz suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
